      "role": "context",
      "modality": "text",
      "quote": "Vocabulary\nConvoy\nA group of vehicles moving together to accomplish a specific mission, particularly transportation or resupply.\nColumn\nA group of vehicles moving under a single command, along the same route and in the same direction, generally\ncorresponding to a battalion-level.\nSerial (French « Rame »)\nA group of approximately 15 to 30 vehicles, generally corresponding to a company-level unit."
